Significance: patch
Type: fixed

A password-protected event now keeps its venue behind the password, like its content, online event link and RSVP responses. Until the password is entered, the venue block and venue map show nothing for that event, and its feed item, calendar downloads and links, iCal feed link and REST response leave the venue out. Whoever can edit the event still sees it. RSVP and event emails still name the venue.
